{
  "id": "psychic-mutation-mind",
  "name": "Mutation Mind",
  "classId": "psychic",
  "summary": "Exposure to unintended spell effects, curses, or sources of radiation cause some to manifest psychic powers. When a mutation mind uses her psychic abilities, her physical body changes under the stress, and she risks losing control if she pushes too far.",
  "replacesText": "1st-level Phrenic Amplification; Phrenic Amplifications; Major Amplifications",
  "mechanicalCoverage": "full",
  "mechanicalNotes": [
    "Physical Mutation tracks its level-scaled Strength bonus, Intelligence penalty, daily minute pool, phrenic extension, dismissal, and fatigue. Basic and improved mutations are selectable and expose only owned controls while transformed. Phrenic Empowerment tracks spell-level duration and its escalating control-save penalty workflow."
  ],
